msgid ""
"This chapter provides detailed hands-on tutorials to help you gain an in-"
"depth understanding of various application scenarios of Kaiwu-PyTorch-"
"Plugin."
msgstr ""
"This chapter provides detailed hands-on tutorials to help you gain an in-"
"depth understanding of various application scenarios of Kaiwu-PyTorch-"
"Plugin."

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:16
msgid ""
"Before you start, make sure you have KPP installed and have gone through "
"the [Quick Start](../quickstart.md). For theoretical background, see "
"[Theoretical Foundations](../../theoretical-foundations/index.md)."
msgstr ""
"Before you start, make sure you have KPP installed and have gone through "
"the [Quick Start](../quickstart.md). For theoretical background, see "
"[Theoretical Foundations](../../theoretical-foundations/index.md)."

